# Claude Code agent worktrees — full repo copies created by background agents,
# typically hundreds of MB. Never commit these to source control.
.claude/worktrees/

# Throwaway scratch sub-project from a background agent run — a separate
# standalone app, not part of this repo. Keep it off `git add -A`.
idea-synthesizer-claude-add-precision-control-slider-QC8rq/

# Personal MCP server config — points at the developer's own Supabase
# project ref. OAuth is per-user, so each contributor adds their own.
.mcp.json

# Personal Claude Code skill files (loaded as system prompt for the
# author's local sessions, not part of the deployed app).
UI agent /
UI agent .zip

# Local app installers downloaded into the repo folder (e.g. a 241MB
# "Granola - AI Notepad.dmg"). Binaries, not source — and GitHub rejects
# files over 100MB anyway.
*.dmg
